WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.810 --> 00:00:16.550
More people in the world currently suffer
from obesity than from hunger.

00:00:16.550 --> 00:00:23.060
The world's longest piece of music lasts an
astonishing 639 years.

00:00:23.060 --> 00:00:27.189
It is called As Slow as Possible.

00:00:27.189 --> 00:00:35.020
There are currently more vacant houses than
homeless people in the United States.

00:00:35.020 --> 00:00:41.640
When adjusted to account for inflation, John
D. Rockefeller was the richest man to have

00:00:41.640 --> 00:00:48.300
ever lived, with a net worth 10 times greater
than Bill Gates.

00:00:48.300 --> 00:00:52.190
In Los Angeles there are more cars than people.

00:00:52.190 --> 00:00:58.500
The average four year old asks over four hundred
questions a day.

00:00:58.500 --> 00:01:05.470
The population of Ireland today is still 2
million less than in was before the potato

00:01:05.470 --> 00:01:09.720
famine, over 160 years ago.

00:01:09.720 --> 00:01:17.259
Just as some people talk in their sleep, sign
language speakers have been known to sign

00:01:17.259 --> 00:01:18.770
in their sleep.

00:01:18.770 --> 00:01:26.649
Whilst Pixar was making Toy Story 2, someone
accidentally ran a Unix command which deleted

00:01:26.649 --> 00:01:30.530
the entire film's data off their servers.

00:01:30.530 --> 00:01:36.479
It was restored thanks to an animator who
kept a copy of it at home so she could work

00:01:36.479 --> 00:01:38.700
on it at home.

00:01:38.700 --> 00:01:42.590
Starfish can re-grow their arms if cut off.

00:01:42.590 --> 00:01:47.579
In fact, a single arm can regenerate a whole
body.

00:01:47.579 --> 00:01:53.539
Velociraptors were actually only about as
big as a modern day turkey.

00:01:53.539 --> 00:02:01.999
Statistically, going to work is three times
more dangerous than war.

00:02:01.999 --> 00:02:07.429
Shakespeare told the first ever "Yo mamma"
joke.

00:02:07.429 --> 00:02:15.830
If you ever run out of candles, a single crayon
will burn for 30 minutes.

00:02:15.830 --> 00:02:23.549
In 2008, pet hamsters were banned in Vietnam.

